 "footer": "Star testing · rolling check pass 2 M-03 (rulebook v1.055; Jeffrey’s “fine”, 2026-11-06, to follow Color Belt’s v0.428). Preview screenshots (fake database, Fall Star Testing, Both schools; Noah Chen paid $140 and is removed; Owen Hart is removed with nothing paid). The “After” column is the real page with the new menu items DRAWN OVER it by a small script (mock-cards.js) — nothing in the app was changed. The staff ⋯ is the app’s own button copied into the row; an open staff menu can’t be opened in the app today, so it is drawn by trimming the admin’s open menu to Print receipt (the Print receipt item itself is the app’s own, copied from an active row’s menu). Amber = what changes; green = the change."
